asset:        glitch-stutter-01.ogg
title:        Digital stutter (sound effect, Kenney "Interface Sounds")
author:       Kenney (www.kenney.nl)
source:       https://kenney.nl/assets/interface-sounds
license:      CC0-1.0
license-file: none
added:        2026-10-15 by sound-design WP1.2b (starter kit)
notes:        From the pack "Interface Sounds (Kenney)" (archive https://kenney.nl/media/pages/assets/interface-sounds/fa43c1dd4d-1677589452/kenney_interface-sounds.zip, sha256 f2193d072726d6758a5f7871b2dcc54dcce0d5c35c6f0a62f92549b327c81232).
              Derived from Kenney's CC0 recording(s) Audio/glitch_004.ogg, Audio/glitch_003.ogg: layered: glitch_004, glitch_003, glitch_004, glitch_003 starting 45 ms apart (a four-step stutter).
              Converted to 48 kHz OGG Vorbis (libvorbis q5, LGPL FFmpeg) by scripts/sounds/curate-starter.ts;
              types glitch, chosen by measurement (judge of @jasper/audio-fx accepts it as glitch).
              The pack page states the licence (Creative Commons CC0) and the archive holds License.txt saying
              "License: (Creative Commons Zero, CC0)"; credit to Kenney is welcome but not required.
